---
import { phases } from "../data/site";
---
<section class="sec sec--mist" id="roadmap">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <h2>Lima fase menuju kesiapan investasi.</h2>
      <p>Setiap fase menghasilkan output yang menjadi syarat fase berikutnya. Perusahaan tidak perlu menunggu semua dokumen selesai untuk mulai memakai sebagiannya.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="track" data-draw>
      <svg class="track__line" viewBox="0 0 1000 40" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="track__path" d="M0 20 H1000" pathLength="1000" />
      </svg>

      <ol class="track__steps">
        {phases.map((ph, i) => (
          <li class="step" data-reveal style={`--d:${i * 110}ms`}>
            <span class="step__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="step__time">{ph.time}</p>
            <h3 class="step__title">{ph.title}</h3>
            <p class="step__focus">{ph.focus}</p>
            <p class="step__out">
              <span>Output</span>
              {ph.output}
            </p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="roadmap__note" data-reveal>
      Urutan ini sengaja dibuat berdasarkan bukti. Kontrak atau LOI pembeli industri menjadi penguat utama untuk fase pendanaan.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .track {
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .track__line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: -9px;
    width: 100%;
    height: 40px;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .track__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sky);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 1000;
    stroke-dashoffset: calc(1000 - (1000 * var(--p)));
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.2s linear;
  }

  .track__steps {
    position: relative;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .step {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 48px;
  }

  .step__dot {
    position: absolute;
    top: 3px;
    left: 0;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--mist);
  }

  .step:nth-child(4) .step__dot,
  .step:nth-child(5) .step__dot {
    background: var(--navy);
  }

  .step__time {
    font: 600 0.8rem/1.2 var(--font-body);
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .step__title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .step__focus {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    min-height: 6.5em;
  }

  .step__out {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .step__out span {
    font: 700 0.72rem/1 var(--font-body);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sky);
  }

  .roadmap__note {
    margin-top: 64px;
    max-width: 60ch;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding-left: 22px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--sky);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .track__steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .track__line {
      display: none;
    }

    .step:nth-child(odd) {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .track__steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .step__focus {
      min-height: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
